WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.410
In Lagos, two software developers kept hearing the same complaint from small businesses.

2
00:00:05.112 --> 00:00:06.932
Taking payments online was slow,

3
00:00:07.212 --> 00:00:10.032
expensive, and built for companies much larger than theirs.

4
00:00:10.698 --> 00:00:12.858
So they built a simpler checkout.

5
00:00:13.318 --> 00:00:15.098
One integration, one dashboard,

6
00:00:15.398 --> 00:00:17.418
and money that arrived where it was needed.

7
00:00:18.038 --> 00:00:19.218
The market was crowded.

8
00:00:19.798 --> 00:00:20.778
Trust was scarce.

9
00:00:21.198 --> 00:00:23.738
And every merchant wanted proof before switching.

10
00:00:24.396 --> 00:00:25.436
Then the numbers moved.

11
00:00:26.136 --> 00:00:27.956
Developers adopted it, investors noticed,

12
00:00:28.456 --> 00:00:32.256
and in 2020 Stripe acquired Paystack for about two hundred million dollars.

13
00:00:33.243 --> 00:00:35.723
The lesson is not that payments are glamorous.

14
00:00:36.123 --> 00:00:36.843
It is that a clear,

15
00:00:36.903 --> 00:00:39.903
useful tool can travel farther than a loud idea.

16
00:00:40.550 --> 00:00:44.570
Small problems, solved properly, can build something the whole world uses.

